  "queue_row": "| 1002 | 30003634 / OWR-15955-011 | Derived Pure Braid Groups in the Solvable Filtration | 0.0903 | 5.5 | 3 | 2017 | claimed_solved | 1/5 |  | 2026-10-08: complete negative candidate accepted unchanged by two independent full mathematical/source audits. Explicit 104-letter beta in P_3^(3) has closure signature -2 (48x48 Goeritz inertia (23,25,0), exact Meyer agreement), while integral smooth 1-solvability forces signature zero. Disproves the universal inclusion at n=1,m=3; split trivial strands extend to all m>=3 at n=1. Direct half-edge diagram verifies the matrix despite Erle's defective printed off-diagonal index. Source-free proof, audits and fail-closed replay: [attempt packet](attempts/30003634/README.md). No separate higher-n, historical-novelty, formal-verification or human-peer-review claim. |  |",
